* Fixed the macOS ChatGPT app (which now reports the bundle identifier of the discontinued Codex app) being listed as "Codex" in software inventory and not shown as installed in self-service. Existing ChatGPT Fleet-maintained app installers are moved to the software title ChatGPT is reported under, and Codex is no longer available as a Fleet-maintained app. In a fleet where other software or a patch policy already uses that title, the ChatGPT installer is left where it is: delete that software or policy, then delete ChatGPT and add it again.
